  "schema_version": 1,
  "kind": "help-article",
  "title": "Skipping IaC Policies",
  "source": {
    "url": "https://help.zscaler.com/zpc/skipping-iac-policies",
    "node": "1412996",
    "revision": "2767621",
    "updated": "2026-01-06",
    "updated_basis": "pdf-last-modified"
  },
  "captured_at": "2026-11-04",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "You can add a rule to skip the required IaC policies while scanning. You need to specify the IaC policy ID in the configuration files and add a skip comment, if required."
    },
    {
      "text": "The following sample code is provided for you:"
    },
    {
      "text": "#zpc-skip-policy: <Policy_ID>: <Comment or Reason for the Skip>"
    },
    {
      "text": "By default, the policies can be skipped. If the administrator has disabled the option to skip a specific policy on the IaC Policies page, then the skip rule is not effective for the specific policy ID. To learn more, see About Security Policies."
    },
    {
      "text": "You can add a skip rule to the following templates:"
    },
    {
      "item": "ARM",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "\"metadata\": { \"zpc-skip-policy\": \"ZS-AZURE-004:comment\" },"
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "item": "Terraform",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "#zpc-skip-policy: ZS-AWS-00030:testing"
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "item": "CloudFormation JSON",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Metadata\": {\"zpc-skip-policy\": \"ZS-AWS-00018,ZS-AWS-00025\"},"
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "item": "CloudFormation YAML",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "Metadata: zpc-skip-policy: \"ZS-AWS-00021:new comment;\""
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "item": "Kubernetes",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "metadata: annotations: zpc-skip-policy: \"ZS-K8S-00006:new comment\""
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    }
  ]
}
